    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Describes one batched matrix-multiply call: C = alpha * A × B + beta * C. All pointer fields are device pointers (GPU) or host pointers (CPU backend). A is [M × K], B is [K × N], C is [M × N]; all stored row-major. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
